Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:40.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}苦労に育てられたけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:45.20,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}今はいらない　いつかは咲きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:49.34,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}右往左往の毎日も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.66,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}これが routine life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.10,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}染みわたっていく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:34.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}开始慢节奏的生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.26,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}这是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:39.26,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:56.23,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}睡前一杯热牛奶 什么都倒映不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:01:01.46,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}或许它挺香甜可口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.59,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但这倒是其次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.88,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.64,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}感觉总也打不起精神来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.92,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}哦这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:17.39,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}原来不用那么累死累活也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:21.45,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}那我应该可以放下心来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:25.20,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}我的人生真奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:31.03,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}过着慢节奏的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:33.66,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}可我还是着急抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.75,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该开心跳舞还是睡个好觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:40.58,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}虽然曾有过一段艰苦的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:45.20,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但现在已不再 我想有一天开花结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:49.34,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}四处奔波的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.66,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}也是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.10,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED1
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.32,0:22:43.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,捧げて　生きてる　意味わからないまま
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.89,0:22:49.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,もういいや　って　今日　なげだしてみよう
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.91,0:22:55.84,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,導き　いつもの　過ぎるだけの時間に
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.95,0:23:01.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,飽きてさ　ただ変わりたいだけだった
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,うつくしい　あなただけの世界　魅せて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.35,0:23:12.83,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}わたしのぜんぶを　届けたいよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.43,0:23:19.58,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,祈りの欠片を　あつめて生きて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.89,0:23:29.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,美しくなんかなくていいよ　望んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.32,0:22:43.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,为别人奉献而生 却不知其意义
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.89,0:22:49.36,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但 就这样吧 今天 就暂且忘掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.91,0:22:55.84,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,遵从既定的引导 从而度过的时间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.95,0:23:01.83,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我早就厌了 我只想将其彻底改变
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.83,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,你的世界 是那么美 让我着迷
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.35,0:23:12.83,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}我愿把我的一切 都献给你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.43,0:23:19.58,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,收集一片片破碎的祈祷 生活下去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.89,0:23:29.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不需要有多么美 期望就好
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED2
